        "author": "frida",
        "became": "apprentice",
        "content": "When there is news of crop failure, frost, or grain spoilage, go to the granary or mill to check the state of the food stores. If the shelves are empty or the grain is bad, report it to the village elders or the market. [!go(to=mill)] [!talk(target=nearby, topic=state of the grain and food stores)]"
