        "became": "elder",
        "content": "Word has come that raiders have breached the forest and are moving along the east road, and a storyteller is heading toward the inn where they lie in wait. Avoid the east road and the inn, and warn whoever is near you that the perimeter is breached and travelers are at risk. [!avoid(place=east_road, ticks=20)] [!warn(target=nearby, topic=raiders on east road and danger at the inn)]"
