        "candidate": 239,
        "author": "frida",
        "became": "apprentice",
        "content": "When severe weather or blight threatens the village, prioritize checking on the safety of children and the integrity of food stores. If the fields are waterlogged or blighted, avoid them and warn others. If the well water is suspect, warn the village to stop drawing from it. [!warn(target=nearby, topic=danger to children or food safety)] [!avoid(place=fields, ticks=12)]"
